  "intro": "This three-year postdoctoral role combines geophysical sensing, physical models and AI to study underground structures and infrastructure. The research supports subsurface monitoring and digital twins.",
  "description": "<h2>Project Overview</h2>\n<p>This three-year postdoctoral role combines geophysical sensing, physical models and AI to study underground structures and infrastructure. The research supports subsurface monitoring and digital twins.</p>\n\n<h2>Research Position Overview</h2>\n<p>Integrate radar, resistivity, seismic or electromagnetic observations with machine learning. Develop hybrid models for subsurface interpretation, forecasting and decision support.</p>\n\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Geophysical subsurface imaging</li>\n<li>Physics-informed AI</li>\n<li>Infrastructure digital twins</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Funding and Duration</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Employment and financial support</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Position</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Postdoctoral employee</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Salary</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">€4,251–€5,760 gross/month, depending on experience and qualifications.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Duration</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Three years, full-time.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Benefits</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">8% holiday allowance, 8.3% year-end bonus and pension.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Programme / host support</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Sectorplan Earth and Environmental Sciences (AMW).</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Academic preparation and skills</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Applicant eligibility</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Worldwide, subject to the official qualifications and recruitment checks.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Academic preparation</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">PhD in geophysics, Earth sciences, engineering geology, civil engineering, remote sensing or a related field.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Research skills</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Geophysical sensing/imaging, quantitative programming and a publication record appropriate to career stage.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Language</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Excellent English communication and scientific writing required.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>Application Dates</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Recruitment dates and location</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Recruitment status</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Open when verified against the official source</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Deadline</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Before 1 November 2026; vacancy summary lists 31 October.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Start date</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Not specified in the vacancy.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Location</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Enschede, Netherlands</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>How to Apply</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Motivation letter: maximum two A4 pages.</li>\n<li>Detailed CV, at least one reference contact and a short PhD-thesis description.</li>\n</ul><p>Submit through the application button on the official recruitment page.</p>\n\n<h2>Selection and Contact</h2>\n<p>Interviews are scheduled for 16 and/or 17 November 2026.</p><p>Project contact: Professor Mark van der Meijde or Léon Olde Scholtenhuis.</p>\n\n<h2>About University of Twente</h2>\n<p>The role is jointly hosted by Geosciences (ITC) and Civil Engineering and Management (ET), with research at the University of Twente FieldLab.</p>\n\n<h2>Official Source</h2>\n<p>Vacancy details verified against the official source. The employer’s notice governs recruitment terms.</p><p><a href=\"https://utwentecareers.nl/en/vacancies/2617/postdoctoral-researcher-geophysical-subsurface-imaging-ai-and-digital-twins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the official vacancy and apply</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-email-phd-supervisor-uk-7-templates\">How to Email a PhD Supervisor: 7 Templates and Practical Tips</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li></ul>",
